# rgbatorgb

- Label: RGBA to RGB
- Category: Copernicus (`Cop`), Houdini 22.0.368
- Inputs: 0 to 1
- Parameters: 1 (exact, read from Houdini by hython)
- Used by the height graph: no

## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/rgbatorgb.html
- Summary (EN): The RGBA to RGB node splits an RGBA layer or attribute into an RGB output and a mono alpha output. It can also undo the premultiplication of the colour channels.
- Résumé (FR) : Le nœud RGBA to RGB sépare une couche RGBA en une sortie RGB et une sortie mono d'alpha, en pouvant annuler la prémultiplication.

- Inputs meaning: ["rgba: the RGBA layer or attribute to split"]

- Key parameters: ["Remove Premultiplied Alpha: when on, undoes premultiplication to give unassociated RGB; when off, RGB and alpha are split directly"]

- Caveats: ["With the toggle off, the RGB output keeps the premultiplied values", "The page does not state the toggle's default value"]

